<title>USA: MHM Services Q2 March 31 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>MHM Services Q2 March 31 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.28     loss	 $1.88</p>
<p> Net loss		     911     loss	 6,201</p>
<p> Revs			 4,136		   11,321</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,312		    3,310</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.55     loss	 $2.26</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,834     loss	 7,497</p>
<p> Revs			 7,865		   22,502</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,311		    3,310</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  MHM Services Inc  said its net income for the first six months of 1996 included a income tax benefit of $175,000.</p>
<p>The company said its losses in the second quarter of 1997 included write-offs, however it was not available to discuss the amounts of the write-offs.</p>
</text>
